  "description": "Map Umbraco Content Types to any of 780+ Schema.org types and automatically generate JSON-LD structured data. Features confidence-scored auto-mapping, a backoffice UI for manual fine-tuning, seven property source types (property, static, parent, ancestor, sibling, block content, complex), HTML/URL/date transforms, culture-aware variant support, Delivery API integration, and a Razor tag helper for server-rendered templates. Can also scaffold new Umbraco document types from Schema.org models.",
